# The native libraries, cross-compiled from `portal-client-ffi`. Large build
# artifacts (an unstripped debug `.so` statically linking OpenSSL/quictls is
# ~200MB) produced by `cargo ndk` -- see the `generateJniLibs` task in
# `app/build.gradle.kts`. Covers both `libportal_client_ffi.so` (the crate's
# own cdylib) and `libmsquic.so` (seera-msquic's separate shared object,
# copied in by the same task since it's dlopened at runtime).
app/src/main/jniLibs/**/*.so

# The Kotlin bindings, generated from the built library by `uniffi-bindgen`.
#
# **Not committed, deliberately.** Same reasoning as the camera app's own
# android/.gitignore: they are generated from the Rust interface, so a copy in
# the tree is a copy that goes stale silently. `generateUniFfiBindings` writes
# them here.
app/build/generated/uniffi/
